                "loc": "EZR.9.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 9:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda araryaruka, kandi bakora ibizira mu Bisirayeli n’i Yerusalemu; kuko Yuda ahumanije ahēra Uhoraho akunda, yābiriye umukobga w’imana y’inyamahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkora ben’ ivyo, Uhoraho azomurandura mu mahema ya Yakobo, ar’ umuteramyi, ar’ uwitaba, ar’ ūshikanira Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo ishikanwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ikigeretseko mukora, mutotesha igicaniro c’Uhoraho amosozi, mwīriza, musuhuza imitima, bigatuma atanakibabaye amashikanwa yanyu, ngw ayākīre ayemeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamara muravuga, muti Ni ku ki? Ni kuk’ Uhoraho yabaye icabona canyu, mwe n’umugore wawe wo mu bucance, uwo waryarutse, nah’ ar’ umugenzi wawe, akaba n’umugore w’isezerano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
