          "text": "Nta wokoze ben’ ivyo, Mpwemu akiri muri we. Ūmufise bimumerera bite? Yifuza kugira uruvyaro ruzokwubaha Imana. Nuko rero mwirinde mu mitima yanyu, ntihagire ūryaruka umugore wiwe wo mu bucance. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.15"
            ]
          }
