        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko nanka ivyo kwahukana, ni k’Uhoraho Imana y’Abisirayeli agize, nanka n’ūtwikira umwambaro wiwe umuryano, ni k’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo agize; nuko rero mwirinde mu mitima yanyu, mwoye kuryarukana.",
